## Scenario 1: Full-width to two columns and back

This paragraph is full-width, spanning the entire page before the column break.

/

This is the left column with some content. It should take up roughly half the page width and sit beside the right column.

|

This is the right column with some content. It should appear next to the left column at roughly the same vertical position.

/

This paragraph returns to full-width after the columns end. It should span the entire page width again.

