## Scenario 3: Columns inside a sidebar layout

right (
# Sidebar
This sidebar takes about one-third of the page width.
)

info (
Left info column content. This info block takes up the remaining two-thirds of the page. The column break below should create two sub-columns within this info block.

|

Right info column content. This text should appear in the second sub-column of the info block, demonstrating that column breaks work inside content blocks.
)
